+++
title: Privacy
+++

**This site:** yomonsni.com itself collects no information about
visitors — no analytics, no tracking scripts, no cookies used to build a
profile of anyone browsing it. Looking around this site doesn't put you
in any database of ours.

**Booking and event registration:** Scheduling a coaching session or
registering for a workshop or retreat happens through an external
booking tool, not this site itself. That tool collects only the
information you choose to provide to complete the booking or
registration, and it is not retained afterward.

**Coaching sessions:** What's discussed in a session is private. A coach
may keep session notes, or — only where a client has consented to it —
a recording. Both are treated as confidential and will not be disclosed
to anyone, except if compelled by an applicable judicial process, and
only if they still exist at that time: all notes and recordings are
destroyed within 90 days of the end of a coaching engagement.
